From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hackii1432 <hunter122@hotmail.de>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 21:40:38 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Restore region-owned data commands and atomic command storage

Register owner-only entity reads and loaded block mutations while keeping Entity.load and cross-region copies unsupported. Resolve console/RCON identities before predicates, guard bounded player and foreign self filters, and await ownership reroutes. Serialize namespace mutations and detached saved-data snapshots under the same container lock; do not expose live tags.

